    "sections": {
      "Highlights": "THIS\u2026 is a 2022 Audi RS6 Avant, finished in Nardo Gray with a black interior. The odometer currently displays approximately 400 miles. The attached Carfax history report shows no accidents or mileage discrepancies in this RS6\u2019s brief past. According to the window sticker provided in the gallery, factory equipment includes the Carbon Optic, Executive, Driver Assistance, and RS Design packages, as well as a sport exhaust, HD Matrix LED headlights, a sunroof, power-adjustable heated and ventilated front seats, a Bang & Olufsen premium sound system with 3D sound, and more as listed below. The seller reports no modifications. After an outcry from dedicated Audi enthusiasts, the manufacturer decided to bring the wagon version of its vaunted RS6 to the U.S. for the first time during the 2020 model year. It received nearly instant critical acclaim for its aggressive styling, everyday practicality, and outstanding performance. Power comes from a 4.0-liter twin-turbocharged V8 engine, rated at 591 horsepower and 590 lb-ft of torque. Output is sent to all four wheels via an 8-speed automatic transmission and Audi\u2019s Quattro all-wheel-drive system.",
      "Equipment": "A window sticker is provided in the photo gallery, and a partial list of notable equipment includes: Carbon Optic Package (22-inch wheels, carbon fiber door mirror caps, carbon optic exterior trim) Executive Package (extended leather upholstery, rear heated seats, head-up display, power soft-closing doors) Driver Assistance Package (Adaptive Cruise Assist with Lane Guidance, Audi Side Assist with Pre Sense Rear, Intersection Assist, Traffic Sign Recognition) RS Design Package (black seat belts with gray edging, gray leather on the dash, armrests, console, RS floor mats with gray edging) Dynamic all-wheel steering Sport exhaust Red-painted brake calipers HD Matrix LED headlights Power-operated sunroof Carbon twill inlays Power-adjustable heated and ventilated front seats Audi Virtual Cockpit Plus digital instrument cluster Audi MMI Navigation Plus Bang & Olufsen Premium sound system with 3D sound 4-zone automatic climate control Surround View camera system Front and rear parking sensors"
    }
